{"id":"u-fcb53eed-5068-47e3-8f05-4012a2debcba","src":"community","title":"Sofinka (ne)pohodinda","author":"Hugo","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/jhc7xf-sofinka-nepohodinda","desc":"Sofinka (ne)pohodinda je 8-týždňový upper/lower program pre začiatočníčku, ktorá už vie cvičiť, ale chce sa konečne poriadne rozbehnúť. Cieľ je jasný: zosilnieť, vybudovať svaly, zlepšiť techniku a vyťažiť čo najviac z beginner progressu bez zbytočne prekombinovaného tréningu. Program je postavený na 4 tréningoch týždenne, základných cvikoch, postupnom progresívnom zaťažení a takom objeme, ktorý je dosť veľký na výsledky, ale stále zvládnuteľný na regeneráciu. Inými slovami: menej chaosu, viac systému, viac sily a viac “aha, takže ja som vlastne dosť atletická”.","level":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Athletics","Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":4,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-23T09:16:11.449Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["U1","L1","Day 3","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Overhead Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":20,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Incline Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"rpe":7,"rpeHi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bulgarian Split Squat (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":2}]},{"n":"Cable Crunch","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"rpe":8,"rpeHi":9,"x":3}]}]}